# NOTE: models/*.joblib and data/*.csv are intentionally TRACKED, not ignored.
# The backend Docker image (Dockerfile.backend) does `COPY models/ data/` and
# Render builds from a fresh git clone, so these artifacts must be present in
# the repo for the deploy to work. Untracking them requires first moving to an
# artifact store / model registry at serve time (see review items #18, #24).

